# NET-MESH-2: two sims, static regions, authority handover by epoch through the store (NET-ARCH §2M.3-§2M.5).
# The coordinator holds a static region table (--region <name>:<sim>:<minX>,<minZ>,<maxX>,<maxZ> cm, a border band
# and a hysteresis margin); WP_Protocol is cut along the street at X = 0 into 'west' (sim 1) and 'east' (sim 2).
# A sim owns the pawns inside its regions and streams the border band of its neighbour as read-only proxies (the
# store sends a sim the pawns of others standing in its band). A pawn past the margin inside the neighbour's region
# is frozen by its owner at mesh step N and published to the store with its unacked inputs; the store
# compare-and-swaps the authority record (sim, epoch) -> (sim', epoch+1) and hands the state to the new owner, which
# promotes its proxy (catching up to the mesh step); the gateway re-routes the player's inputs on the store's
# AuthorityChanged; inputs that still reached the old owner are forwarded through the store.
# Runner: <scratch>/NET-MESH-2/run_mesh2.sh (base NET-MESH-1 run_mesh1.sh): 5 server processes; the editor is B,
# A is a DesertNetProbe bot.
# Дано: Editor + DesertServer + DesertNetProbe from task/NET-MESH-2; mesh = coordinator, store, sim 1, sim 2, gateway; regions west (sim 1) | east (sim 2) cut at X = 0, margin 300 cm, band 1500 cm.
# Когда: B (editor, spawn on the east side) stands still; bot A walks 2000 cm along +X from (-1000, 92, -500) across X = 0 at 90 cm/s (--dir 0.15).
# PASS 11-23 (run_mesh2.sh run 2): frames 150/185/195 one A capsule ~5 px/frame across x=301 handover; store "authority (sim 1, epoch 1) -> (sim 2, epoch 2) at step 5836"; gateway re-routed at 5836; A +43..47 cm per 0.5 s throughout.
# Тогда [mesh2_cross_border] mesh2-cross/clientB_*.png: B's frames show A's pawn moving continuously across the border (one pawn, no pop, no double); clientA.log own-pawn positions advance evenly through the handover (no snap); store.log "authority (sim 1, epoch 1) -> (sim 2, epoch 2) at step N" once for A; gateway.log "input player <A> -> sim 2" with the same epoch; sim2.log "proxy pawn" before "adopted".
